{
	"contentrating": "Everyone",
	"description": "[h1]Blue Archive | Blu-ray exclusive Memorial Lobby[/h1]\nAn interactive Spine Live2D memorial lobby for Wallpaper Engine.\nBGM: Shooting Stars - Blue Archive Original Soundtrack Vol.1 ~Longing for the memorable days～\n\nCharacters: Okusora Ayane, Takanashi Hoshino, Izayoi Nonomi, Kuromi Serika, Sunaookami Shiroko\n\n[h2]On-screen interactions[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Select a character or choose Random\n[*]Optional intro animation\n[*]Head patting and cursor eye tracking\n[*]Toggleable interaction-area overlay to preview clickable regions (accessible under Show Mouse Actions)\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Cursor and click effects[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Blue Archive pointer cursor and click/drag effects with an optional persistent trail\n[*]Fallback particle click effects with Light, Dark, or Follow System color themes when BA Pointer Style is disabled\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Display, subtitles and localization[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]2K, 4K and 8K model resolution options\n[*]Adjustable scale, X/Y position, background color, and target frame rate (30–144 FPS)\n[*]Wallpaper settings UI localized in English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean and Thai\n[/list]\n\n[h2]Credits[/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Spine rendering uses [url=https://github.com/EsotericSoftware/spine-runtimes]spine-webgl[/url].\n[*]Model textures were upscaled with [url=https://github.com/nihui/realcugan-ncnn-vulkan]Real-CUGAN[/url].\n[*]Thanks to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=2956165539]Blue Archive Fully Interactive L2D Mini-Collection[/url].\n[/list]\n\n[quote]Blue Archive is a registered trademark of NAT GAMES Co., Ltd., NEXON Korea Corp., and Yostar, Inc.\n This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to NAT GAMES Co., Ltd., NEXON Korea Corp., NEXON GAMES Co., Ltd., IODivision, Yostar, Inc., or any of their subsidiaries or affiliates.\n All game assets, content, and materials are copyrighted by their respective owners and are used for informational and educational purposes only.[/quote]",
